{"chunk_id": "5d4ea8a0-2e2a-4ce8-93eb-5e03eac56c4a", "doc_id": "03-privacy-avoidance", "text": "## 1. 本章导读\n\n本章讨论的不是“理论上能否零采集”，而是“用户实际能做哪些事情来降低暴露面”。\n\n结论先行：如果用户要最小化暴露，需要同时控制三件事：\n\n1. 不让敏感内容进入模型上下文\n2. 不让 transcript / memory 长期落盘\n3. 不开启同步、遥测、分享和远程能力", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第三章：从用户角度看，如何规避或降低信息收集 > 1. 本章导读", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 148}
{"chunk_id": "e319b346-1298-4d07-9a83-07b1c8171fc7", "doc_id": "03-privacy-avoidance", "text": "本章讨论的不是“理论上能否零采集”，而是“用户实际能做哪些事情来降低暴露面”。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 0, "parent_id": "5d4ea8a0-2e2a-4ce8-93eb-5e03eac56c4a", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第三章：从用户角度看，如何规避或降低信息收集 > 1. 本章导读", "metadata": {"block_id": "3c2a3d75-e0ce-4c45-a4af-8089c8a32224"}, "char_len": 39}
{"chunk_id": "a519263a-ec72-4ee6-be76-29dcd671b101", "doc_id": "03-privacy-avoidance", "text": "结论先行：如果用户要最小化暴露，需要同时控制三件事：", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 0, "parent_id": "5d4ea8a0-2e2a-4ce8-93eb-5e03eac56c4a", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第三章：从用户角度看，如何规避或降低信息收集 > 1. 本章导读", "metadata": {"block_id": "602eebe0-7732-4f7c-82c3-8ff063d63494"}, "char_len": 26}
{"chunk_id": "bd15a8cc-7aa1-41d2-8017-d1c088e69c61", "doc_id": "03-privacy-avoidance", "text": "1. 不让敏感内容进入模型上下文\n2. 不让 transcript / memory 长期落盘\n3. 不开启同步、遥测、分享和远程能力", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 0, "parent_id": "5d4ea8a0-2e2a-4ce8-93eb-5e03eac56c4a", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第三章：从用户角度看，如何规避或降低信息收集 > 1. 本章导读", "metadata": {"block_id": "56529417-6fa5-4e27-8ed2-089a3fc49449"}, "char_len": 67}
{"chunk_id": "b01a3792-aea6-46d4-b2c1-7031755cd4b3", "doc_id": "03-privacy-avoidance", "text": "## 2. 先分清三类风险\n\n要规避信息收集，至少要区分：\n\n1. `发给模型的内容`\n2. `本地持久化的内容`\n3. `上传到外部服务的内容`\n\n很多人只盯着第 3 类，但对 coding agent 来说，第 1 类通常更敏感。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第三章：从用户角度看，如何规避或降低信息收集 > 2. 先分清三类风险", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 117}
